@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.publication
@title Media loading — common media publication
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry cargo-ready
@summary Trace publication of the final viewer cargo and the shared subscribers that synchronize visible/common workspace state.
@related functionality.media-loading.edit
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag publication

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias source = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PSource
@alias info = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInfo
@alias workspace = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PWorkspace

[cargo-ready] Final viewer cargo ready <input>
= A failure/restriction or successful preview commit has produced the LCargo that represents the current viewer outcome.
> publish

[publish] Viewer media publication <process>
- Publish the resulting LCargo to every attached viewer-media subscriber @ viewer.PViewerMediaRaise(...)
- Attach or clear the active flow according to whether media information is available @ window.PWindowMediaHandle(...)
- Synchronize an attached Source field with the resulting source path @ source.PSourceMediaHandle(...)
- Synchronize an attached Info panel with processability, preview availability, parsed media information, or failure status @ info.PInfoMediaHandle(...)
- For applicable non-audio workspaces, remember the source and schedule or clear LosslessCut discovery @ workspace.PWorkspaceMediaHandle(...)
- For a relay-load subscription, restore relayed sections after media information becomes available @ workspace.PWorkspaceRelayApply(...)
> publication-result

[publication-result] Shared media state synchronized <output>
= Shared subscribers update only where their corresponding viewer, Source/Info panel, flow, or workspace hook is attached; tab-specific subscribers remain in the scenario-specific maps.
